 </semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>, and <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{Q rSub { size 8{h} } } {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>  is given, so the efficiency is</p><div data-type="equation" id="eip-607"><math display="block"><semantics><mrow>
